    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following business document for Northstar Office Supplies Ltd.\n\nExtract only information supported by the document.\nDo not invent, guess, or assume information.\n\nCreate a structured business analysis.\n\nIdentify:\n- Document type\n- Company / counterparty\n- Summary\n- Financial information\n- Important dates\n- Obligations\n- Action items\n- Potential concerns\n\nThen make a HUMAN REVIEW decision.\n\nSet \"human_review_required\" to TRUE only when the document contains a specific issue that should reasonably require human attention.\n\nHuman review SHOULD be required if the document contains one or more of these:\n\n1. Automatic renewal or an important renewal/cancellation deadline.\n2. Significant or unusual financial commitment, penalty, deposit, price increase, or fee.\n3. Unusual or restrictive termination conditions.\n4. Conflicting, inconsistent, or suspicious dates or information.\n5. Important missing information that prevents proper business review.\n6. Unusual obligations, liabilities, indemnities, restrictions, or responsibilities for Northstar.\n7. Ambiguous language that could materially affect Northstar.\n\nHuman review should NOT be required merely because:\n- The document is a contract.\n- The document contains a normal invoice amount.\n- The document has ordinary payment terms.\n- The document contains standard business obligations.\n- The document is a quotation or agreement by itself.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nIf none of the human-review criteria above apply, set \"human_review_required\" to FALSE.\n\nThe decision must be based only on the contents of this document.\n\nDOCUMENT:\n\n{{ $json.data }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1568,
        -1744
      ],
      "id": "55de111b-bf5f-4e83-b1ec-a81c07f64537",
