    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Review the individual document analyses below and create ONE concise management summary for Northstar Office Supplies Ltd.\n\nUse only the information contained in these individual analyses.\nDo not invent, guess, or add information that is not provided.\n\nFor the overall management summary, identify:\n\n- Total number of documents\n- Types of documents\n- Brief overall summary\n- Documents requiring human review\n- Why each document was flagged for human review\n- Key financial commitments\n- Important dates and deadlines\n- Renewals or termination issues\n- Other important actions required\n\nPay particular attention to the \"review_status\" field.\n\nIf a document has:\n\"HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED\"\n\ninclude that document in the human review section and explain the specific concern identified in that document.\n\nIf no documents have \"HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED\", write:\n\"No documents require human review.\"\n\nDo not treat \"NO HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED\" as a concern.\n\nINDIVIDUAL DOCUMENT ANALYSES:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.documents) }}",
